{
  "id": "universal-jc-upsmash",
  "name": "Jump-cancel up smash",
  "part": "tech",
  "characters": "all",
  "goal": "An up smash out of a dash",
  "why": "A dash cannot be turned into an up smash directly. Jumping first and pushing the C-stick up right after the jump gives an up smash that slides with the dash's speed, so {char} can run in and up smash at once.",
  "tutorial": {
    "camera": {
      "follow": "player",
      "distance": 120,
      "height": 10
    },
    "what": "A jump-cancelled up smash is an up smash input right after the jump, before {char} leaves the ground. It turns the jump into an up smash on the ground.",
    "expect": "Each jump is judged when {char} up smashes or leaves the ground: whether it was an up smash, and how many frames after the jump. After misses, the coach shows your jump and C-stick frame by frame.",
    "example": [
      {
        "stick": [
          1,
          0
        ],
        "frame": 1,
        "hold": 6
      },
      {
        "press": "jump",
        "frame": 6,
        "hold": 1
      },
      {
        "cstick": [
          0,
          1
        ],
        "frame": 7
      }
    ],
    "marks": {
      "1": "Frame 1: control stick forward: dash",
      "6": "Frame 6: jump pressed",
      "7": "Frame 7: C-stick up: up smash, still sliding"
    },
    "lessons": [
      {
        "title": "An up smash right after the jump",
        "text": [
          "Right after the jump button is pressed, the game still accepts an up smash until {char} leaves the ground: the C-stick pushed up, or A with the control stick up. On frames 2 to {J} after the jump's press, {char} up smashes from the ground instead of jumping.",
          "On frame {J+1} {char} is in the air, and the C-stick gives an up air."
        ],
        "show": {
          "example": {
            "inputs": [
              {
                "press": "jump",
                "frame": 1,
                "hold": 1
              },
              {
                "cstick": [
                  0,
                  1
                ],
                "frame": 2
              }
            ],
            "marks": {
              "1": "Frame 1: jump pressed",
              "2": "Frame 2: C-stick up: up smash"
            },
            "cues": [
              {
                "frames": [
                  2,
                  "J"
                ],
                "words": "C-stick up now: up smash",
                "kind": "go"
              },
              {
                "frames": [
                  "J+1",
                  "J+1"
                ],
                "words": "C-stick up here: up air",
                "kind": "late"
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "title": "Out of a dash",
        "text": [
          "During a dash, the C-stick up does nothing and A gives a dash attack: there is no up smash from a dash. Press jump, then the C-stick up 1 to {J-1} frames later, and {char} up smashes, sliding with the dash's speed.",
          "Pushed on the same frame as the jump, the C-stick is read in the dash and does nothing."
        ],
        "show": {
          "example": {
            "inputs": [
              {
                "stick": [
                  1,
                  0
                ],
                "frame": 1,
                "hold": 6
              },
              {
                "press": "jump",
                "frame": 6,
                "hold": 1
              },
              {
                "cstick": [
                  0,
                  1
                ],
                "frame": 7
              }
            ],
            "marks": {
              "1": "Frame 1: control stick forward: dash",
              "6": "Frame 6: jump pressed",
              "7": "Frame 7: C-stick up: up smash, still sliding"
            },
            "cues": [
              {
                "frames": [
                  1,
                  5
                ],
                "words": "Dash",
                "kind": "info"
              },
              {
                "frames": [
                  6,
                  6
                ],
                "words": "Jump",
                "kind": "info"
              },
              {
                "frames": [
                  7,
                  "J+5"
                ],
                "words": "C-stick up now: up smash",
                "kind": "go"
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      }
    ]
  },
